{"parse":{"title":"Patch notes","pageid":332968,"revid":629811,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Patch notes</b> are posts detailing changes and additions to the game as it is being developed. As <a href=\"/w/SMITE_2\" title=\"SMITE 2\">SMITE 2</a> is in active development, patch notes are relatively frequent and can make significant changes to the game. Smaller hotfixes are sometimes released in between major patches, usually to address unexpected and problematic bugs in the game.\n</p><p>Lists of all posted patch notes can be found below. Official patch notes can also be read at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.smite2.com/news/\">https://www.smite2.com/news/</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Open_Beta_patch_notes\">Open Beta patch notes</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Patch_notes?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Open Beta patch notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Patch_notes?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Open Beta patch notes\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Release Date\n</th>\n<th>Patch\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>October 20, 2026\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/SMITE_2_Open_Beta_46\" title=\"SMITE 2 Open Beta 46\">SMITE 2 Open Beta 46</a>\n</td>\n<td>King Kappa Update\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>October 6, 2026\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/SMITE_2_Open_Beta_45\" title=\"SMITE 2 Open Beta 45\">SMITE 2 Open Beta 45</a>\n</td>\n<td>Goddess Of Victory Update\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>September 22, 2026\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/SMITE_2_Open_Beta_44\" title=\"SMITE 2 Open Beta 44\">SMITE 2 Open Beta 44</a